rule.docs:
Summary

- Name: noUselessThisAlias
- Fix: safe
- Default severity: info
- Available from version: 1.0.0
- Diagnostic category: lint/complexity/noUselessThisAlias
- This rule is recommended

Description

 Disallow useless `this` aliasing.

 Arrow functions inherits `this` from their enclosing scope;
 this makes `this` aliasing useless in this situation.

Examples

Invalid

 ```js,expect_diagnostic
 class A {
     method() {
         const self = this;
         return () => {
             return self;
         }
     }
 }
 ```

Valid

 ```js
 class A {
     method() {
         const self = this;
         return function() {
             this.g();
             return self;
         }
     }
 }
 ```

